<title>UK: Italy to launch jumbo mark 10-year bond - bankers.</title>
<headline>Italy to launch jumbo mark 10-year bond - bankers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy is expected to issue a large mark 10-year bond during the Thursday morning Eurobond session, bankers said.</p>
<p>Traders said the issue size was expected to be around 2.0 billion marks.</p>
<p>Earlier, the Italian Treasury said it would issue a long-dated mark bond via Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and SBC Warburg. The lead managers declined to comment on terms of the deal.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
